<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When doubts and fears arise,</l><l>Teach me Thy way;</l><l>When storms o’erspread the skies,</l><l>Teach me Thy way.</l><l>Shine through the cloud and rain,</l><l>Through sorrow, toil, and pain;</l><l>Make Thou my pathway plain,</l><l>Teach me Thy way.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Long as my life shall last,</l><l>Teach me Thy way;</l><l>Where’er my lot be cast,</l><l>Teach me Thy way.</l><l>Until the race is run,</l><l>Until the journey’s done,</l><l>Until the crown is won,</l><l>Teach me Thy way.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
